# fault: the next word is cleared when the pushed bit is bit 30 (b = 30 for 31): after a push of bit 31 the delimiter word keeps its junk, after bit 30 a word holding no bits yet is cleared (harmless)
# why: off-by-one
# file: src/obj.bend
# sym: app_old31,bits_close_go,bits_close
--- a/src/obj.bend
+++ b/src/obj.bend
@@ -1516,3 +1516,3 @@
 # The next word is touched only when it is inside the storage (after the fit it always is).
-def app_old31(+old: U32, +b: U32) -> U32: pick(U32.is_eq(b, 31), 0, old)
+def app_old31(+old: U32, +b: U32) -> U32: pick(U32.is_eq(b, 30), 0, old)
 
